   "subject": "handling of default visualization conditions",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>How should a ggolot2 visualization display a default condition in a shiny app?</div><div><br></div><div>For example, user interaction results in an empty data frame as input to ggplot2, yielding blank screen and error messages like these:</div><div><br></div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Error:  Aesthetics must be either length 1 or the same as the data (1): y, x, fontface, size, fill, alpha, label</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"> ... and ...</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Error:  argument is of length zero</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">My solution is to test for the default condition and display a text box explanation instead of the ggplot2 viz. </span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Wondering of any suggestions for handling display of default ggplot2 conditions in shiny.  </span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Thanks</span></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><br></div><div>  </div></div>"
